      "updated": 1792156379694,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Expression\n==========\n\n1. In Programming expressions are statement which\ncontains expression and operands .\n\nTypes of Expression\n-------------------------\n\n1. Infix --> Operator between operands .\n\n2. Prefix (POLISH NOTATION) --> operators before\noperands .\n\n3. Postfix (REVERSE POLISH NOTATION) -->\nOperators after operands .",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Expression\n==========\n\n1. In Programming expressions are statement which contains expression and operands .\n\nTypes of Expression\n-------------------------\n\n1. Infix --> Operator between operands .\n\n2. Prefix (POLISH NOTATION) --> operators before operands .\n\n3. Postfix (REVERSE POLISH NOTATION) --> Operators after operands .",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    }
